algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: Block-Diagonal Verification
Input: Block-diag matrices A, B, C with k blocks
Output: ACCEPT or (REJECT, failing block index)

for i = 1 to k:
    if A_i * B_i != C_i:
        return (REJECT, i)
return (ACCEPT, None)

Complexity: O(sum n_i^3) time
Speedup: k^2 for equal blocks
